name hep-bibliography
category Package
revision 61166
shortdesc An acronym extension for glossaries
longdesc The hep-bibliography package extends the BibLaTeX package with
longdesc some functionality mostly useful for high energy physics. In
longdesc particular it makes full use of all BibTeX fields provided by
longdesc Discover High-Energy Physics. The package is loaded with
longdesc \usepackage{hep-bibliography}.
